<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="theme-color" content="#0c1722"><title>Nathan AI · Assistant</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="../hub.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="../sovereign/style.css"><style>.assistant-hero{padding:36px 0}.assistant-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 300px;gap:24px;align-items:start}.turn{padding:24px;border:1px solid #355365;background:#132b3a;border-radius:12px;margin:18px 0;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.turn pre{font:inherit;white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.citation{padding:12px;margin:8px 0;border-left:3px solid #6ae4d8}.citation p{white-space:pre-wrap}.assistant-check{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:start}.assistant-check input{width:auto;flex:0 0 auto}.assistant-controls{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}.assistant-controls button{flex:1}.assistant-sidebar{position:sticky;top:20px}.assistant-sidebar a{display:block;margin:12px 0}.question-row textarea{min-height:140px}.assistant-check label{margin:0}#conversation[hidden]{display:none}#question-status{overflow-wrap:anywhere}@media(max-width:800px){.assistant-grid{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}.assistant-sidebar{position:static;grid-row:2}}</style><script src="../workspace.js" defer></script><script src="../sovereign/engine.js" defer></script><script src="engine.js" defer></script><script src="../plugins/engine.js" defer></script><script src="app.js" defer></script><link rel="stylesheet" href="../appearance/shared.css" data-nathan-shared-appearance><script src="../appearance/engine.js"></script><script src="../appearance/app.js"></script><link rel="stylesheet" href="../launcher/shared.css" data-nathan-command-center><script src="../launcher/engine.js" defer></script><script src="../launcher/app.js" defer></script></head><body><main>
<header><a class="brand" href="../index.html">NATHAN AI <span>ASSISTANT</span></a><a class="button" href="../index.html#workspace">Research workspace</a><a class="button" href="../universal-workspace/index.html">Universal Workspace · No token credits</a></header>
<section class="assistant-hero"><p class="eyebrow">ASK · READ · CONNECT · BUILD</p><h1>Think with your sources.</h1><p class="intro">Ask about the work already here. Find the relevant passages, follow their source stages, and turn the next step into something you can build.</p><p id="model-status" role="status">Checking optional model adapter…</p></section>
<div class="assistant-grid"><div><section class="editor"><h2>Your context, your choice.</h2><button type="button" id="load">Load public source catalogs</button><p id="coverage" role="status">Public sources have not loaded yet.</p><button type="button" id="load-plugins">Load app/plugin capabilities</button><p id="plugin-coverage" role="status">Plugin workflows are available through the App &amp; Plugin Hub.</p><label class="assistant-check"><input id="include-local" type="checkbox"><span>Include my local coin/life graph and saved research in source search. These stay in this browser unless I separately choose a model request.</span></label><details><summary>Catalog coverage</summary><ul id="coverage-list"></ul></details></section>
<form id="question-form" class="editor question-row"><label for="question">What would you like to work on?</label><textarea id="question" maxlength="4000" required placeholder="Ask a specific question about a title, coin, source, formula or implementation…"></textarea><label for="mode">Response mode<select id="mode"><option value="answer">Source passages &amp; citations</option><option value="plan">Source passages &amp; next-step checklist</option></select></label><label class="assistant-check"><input type="checkbox" id="use-model" disabled><span>Use the configured model for this question. Only the question and the source excerpts listed below are sent to the local adapter and configured provider. Provider usage may incur charges.</span></label><div id="selected-sources"></div><div class="assistant-controls"><button type="button" id="preview">Find relevant sources</button><button id="ask" class="primary">Answer from selected context</button><button type="button" id="cancel" disabled>Cancel model request</button></div><p id="question-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p></form>
<section id="conversation" aria-label="Conversation"><h2>Working conversation</h2><div id="turns"></div></section><section class="editor"><h3>Keep the work</h3><p>Conversations stay in memory until you choose Save. Saved conversations use this browser profile; exports may contain your questions and selected source excerpts. Keep backups private.</p><div class="assistant-controls"><button type="button" id="save">Save conversation on this device</button><button type="button" id="export">Export conversation</button><button type="button" id="clear">Clear conversation</button></div><label for="restore">Restore conversation backup<input type="file" id="restore" accept=".json,application/json"></label><p id="save-status" role="status"></p></section></div>
<aside class="source-links assistant-sidebar"><p><a href="../hop-in/chatbox/index.html?mode=snow">❄ Original Words · Snow Family 19-Level Chat Mode</a></p><h3>Keep building Nathan AI</h3><a href="../plugins/index.html">App &amp; Plugin Hub</a><a href="../sovereign/index.html">Coin, life &amp; source connections</a><a href="../node-runtime/index.html">Formula &amp; Node Runtime</a><a href="../deep-archive/index.html">Deep Archive</a><a href="../../one/offloader/index.html">Sealed Voice Box</a><a href="../../vault.html">Creator Vault</a><p>Source mode retrieves existing passages; it is not generative model inference. Model drafts cite only the supplied source IDs and do not execute actions. Never enter passwords, keys or recovery phrases.</p></aside></div>
<footer>Local source-first assistant · Optional loopback model adapter · No tools, transactions or autonomous external actions.</footer>
</main></body></html>
